        "topic_1": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery & Returns"
          }
        },
        "q_2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "When can I expect my order?",
            "a": "<p>Deliveries across Denmark typically arrive within two working days. Place your order by 2 PM on weekdays, and we’ll ship it out the same day from Brøndby.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How much does delivery cost?",
            "a": "<p>Nothing. Delivery is free across Denmark, to a parcel shop, a locker or your door.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is your return policy?",
            "a": "<p>If you are not completely happy, you can return your order within 14 days. Items should be unused and in their original condition. New, unused items are refunded to the original payment method. Lightly tested items may be eligible for store credit. Final-sale items cannot be returned.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_5": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I change or cancel my order?",
            "a": "<p>There is a short window of about 60 minutes after you order. Contact us straight away. Once an order is packed or shipped, it cannot be changed, but you can use our free returns.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_6": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do you ship outside Denmark?",
            "a": "<p>We start our journey in Denmark, so at launch we ship only within Denmark. We are preparing to deliver to the other Scandinavian countries and across the EU. Join the Cozy Club to hear first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_7": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Is your packaging sustainable?",
            "a": "<p>Our packaging is made from recycled materials and kept minimal. It is designed to be reused, including as the bag for a return.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_9": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Yarn & Quality"
          }
        },
        "q_10": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What does \"rescued yarn\" mean?",
            "a": "<p>Rescued yarn is the pristine, luxury surplus left behind by fashion houses at the end of each season. This material is set aside strictly due to excess quantity, not a lack of quality. We rescue this premium surplus and reimagine it into exclusive new designs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_11": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Does using \"rescued yarn\" affect quality?",
            "a": "<p>Not at all. Many of our yarns were made for premium fashion and retail brands, including cotton, wool and specialist blends. The only reason they remain is quantity, not quality.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_12": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Why are your pieces limited edition?",
            "a": "<p>Our pieces are made in small quantities from leftover yarn that exists in limited amounts. Once that yarn is used, the same design or colour may not be repeated.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_13": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can you restock a piece once it sells out?",
            "a": "<p>Some items may return in a new colourway or updated design, but once sold out they are not restocked exactly the same. If a piece speaks to you, it may be best to make it yours while it is available.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_14": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Why are colours sometimes limited?",
            "a": "<p>Because many collections are made from limited yarn quantities, some colours come in small runs only. Once a yarn is used, we may not be able to find the exact shade again.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_15": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will the colours look exactly the same in person?",
            "a": "<p>We photograph colours as accurately as we can. Small differences can come from lighting, screens and the natural character of yarn blends.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_16": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Where are your products made?",
            "a": "<p>In our own family-run knitwear factory in China, owned and managed by our parent company JM Group Limited, a family business founded in 1946 and based in Hong Kong. This gives us direct oversight of craftsmanship, quality and responsible production.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_17": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Are your products ethically made?",
            "a": "<p>Yes. We work in line with BSCI social compliance principles for fair working conditions, and with OCS and RCS certified materials where they apply. We also support WWF Hong Kong.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_18": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Care"
          }
        },
        "q_19": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How should I care for my knitted piece?",
            "a": "<p>We recommend airing your knits often and washing them sparingly. When a wash is needed, gently hand wash in cold water and lay flat to dry to preserve the silhouette. You can explore our full Size &amp; Care Guide for detailed rituals.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_20": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do your cushion covers come with the inner cushion?",
            "a": "<p>No. Covers are sold without inners, so you can choose your own filling and firmness.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_21": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Gifting"
          }
        },
        "q_22": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Why give EchoByJMG as gifts?",
            "a": "<p>EchoByJMG pieces are thoughtful gifts with beauty, comfort, and meaning behind them. All of our collections are made in limited quantities using premium leftover yarns, making each gift feel more personal and unique.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_23": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will the price be shown on the packaging?",
            "a": "<p>No. No prices are printed in the order. Confirmations and receipts are sent to the buyer by email.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_24": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do you offer gift wrapping?",
            "a": "<p>Every order is wrapped in our own tissue paper, with a little surprise gift inside.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_25": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I send it straight to the recipient?",
            "a": "<p>Yes. Enter their address at checkout. The receipt is emailed to you, not to them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_26": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is the latest date I can order to ensure my gifts arrive before Christmas?",
            "a": "<p>Order by 19 December for delivery before Christmas Eve.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
